From: srcdynroute project <srcdynroute@local>
Subject: [PATCH 1001] nftables: add DYNSRCROUTE/DYNRT statement support

Adds bare-keyword statements DYNSRCROUTE (target) and DYNRT (match)
for the out-of-tree srcdynroute kernel module (kernels >= 6.12.111
with patches 0001-0005, module srcdynroute.ko loaded). Generated
against nftables 1.1.3 (pristine tarball). Apply with 'patch -p1 -d
<nftables-root>' or 'git apply' then ./configure && make.

